&lt;li&gt;Jashemski, Wilhelmina F, 1993. &lt;em&gt;The Gardens of Pompeii, Herculaneum, and the Villas Destroyed by Vesuvius, vol.II&lt;/em&gt;, p. 85. &lt;a href="https://search.worldcat.org/title/769881162" target="_blank"&gt;worldcat&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
